This commit changes the syntax for collection-iterator comprehension, replacing the old listof/setof/mapof/etc comprehensions.

[x^2 for x from 1 to 10]
{x^2 for x from 1 to 10}
{x^2 => x for x from 1 to 10}

tableof and sumof are poor patterns and are removed.

